The '''Carnival Mask Bag''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]] that can be store [[Carnival Masks]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Carnival Mask Bag''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} in the {{Zone|Carnival}} for {{Carnival Tokens|250}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = common
|special_effect = Holds [[Carnival Mask]]s. Each unique Mask within this bag grants {{Stat|Intelligence|+1}}.
|special_effect_stats = Intelligence
}}
The '''Carnival Mask Bag''' can store [[Carnival Mask]]s. Each unique mask in the bag grants the player {{Stat|int|+1}}, with the bag being able to hold up to 9 total.

